---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us — ToolSite">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 prose prose-sm">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">About ToolSite</h1>
    <p>ToolSite is a collection of free, fast, no-signup online tools built for developers, writers, and everyday users. Every tool runs directly in your browser — nothing you type or paste is uploaded to a server, so your data stays private.</p>
    <p>We built this site to solve a simple problem: too many "free" tools online are cluttered with intrusive ads, require sign-ups, or are slow to load. ToolSite aims to be fast, clean, and genuinely useful.</p>
    <p>New tools are added regularly. If there's a tool you'd like to see, reach out via our <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600">Contact page</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>